<section id="A3.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.8 </span>LLM-as-a-Judge for Explanations</h3>

<div id="A3.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Prompt adapted from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">Sanders and Van Durme (2025)</a></cite>.</p>
<div id="A3.SS8.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
